  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">About This Project</h2>
  <p>Berlindisch is a Berlin-born collective exploring the intersection of diaspora culture, food, trade, and venture building. Our work spans journalism, cultural programming, events, editorial projects, and community collaboration.</p>
  <p>This website serves as an informational and editorial platform for the collective. It does not currently offer commercial transactions, paid services, or e-commerce functionality.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Legal Structure</h2>
  <p>As an early-stage informal collective, Berlindisch does not currently hold a trade registration (Gewerbeanmeldung), VAT identification number, or formal nonprofit status.</p>
  <p>Formal legal structures, including potential incorporation as an association (e.V.), UG, or other entity, may be introduced in future phases as the collective grows and formalizes its operations.</p>

